s":"CC0","publisher":"32069b11-a9d2-42e2-aa9c-b16350444909","totalCount":9302779,"hitRatio":2.1498952087327885e-7},{"uuid":"4523e216-ee13-4b15-a3f7-a6fd56431604","itemCount":1,"name":"Louisiana State University, Shirley C. Tucker Herbarium - Vascular Plants","description":"Shirley C. Tucker Herbarium at Louisiana State University, Vascular Plant Collection contains 310,000+ specimens. Several regional herbaria are integrated entirely or in part, including NO, LSUS, MCN, NLU, Eglin Air Force Base, and New Orleans Academy of Sciences. Only Tulane University Herbarium (NO) remains a distinct collection.&nbsp;&nbsp;Geographic distribution is global, but strengths are Louisiana and the southeastern USA, southen California, Colorado Rocky Mountains, Yucatan Peninsula, Colombia and Brazil. Families well-represented include Asteraceae, Fabaceae, Cyperaceae, Rubiaceae, and Poaceae. Significant collectors include: Fr. G. Ars&egrave;ne, L. M. Booth,&nbsp;C. A. Brown,&nbsp;I. W. Clokey, R. S. Cocks, D. Demaree,&nbsp;J. A. Ewan,&nbsp;A. Featherman,&nbsp;A. Gray, J. Hale, J. F. Joor, D. D. Keck, E. P. Killip, J. G. Lemmon, Y. E. J. Mexia, F. W. Peirson,&nbsp;N. F. Peterson,&nbsp;J. L. Riddell, and D. Stone,&nbsp;R. D. Thomas, S. C. Tucker, L. E. Urbatsch, I. V&eacute;lez, and E. C. Wurzlow.","logo":"https://sernecportal.org/portal/content/collicon/lsu.jpg","url":"http://www.herbarium.lsu.edu/","emllink":"https://sernecportal.org/portal/collections/datasets/emlhandler.php?collid=210","archivelink":"https://sernecportal.org/portal/content/dwca/lsu-vascularplants_dwc-a.zip","contacts":[{"email":"hbrown@mailbox.sc.edu"},{"email":"hbrown@mailbox.sc.edu"},{"email":"jkluse@lsu.edu"},{"last_name":"Jennifer S. Kluse, Collections Manager","email":"jkluse@lsu.edu"},{"last_name":"Jennifer S. Kluse, Collections Manager","email":"jkluse@lsu.edu"}],"data_rights":"CC3 BY-NC","publisher":"42f2a0a4-5981-4874-88d5-9efb1e8d52c9","totalCount":316835,"hitRatio":0.0000031562169583537174}],"aggs":{"rs":